  phase_plan.user: the per-phase plan-creation user prompt. Inputs:
  approved roadmap path, phase metadata (number/name/type/goal), prior
  phase plans, upstream Q&A files, stubs to retire, deferrals due this
  phase.

  Visual references live with the design/roadmap — they are NOT
  re-injected here. Q&A files (inquire/research/design/roadmap
  qa-answers.md) ARE re-injected so the planner reads the user's prior
  decisions verbatim and does not re-litigate them. The
  worktree-exploration discipline for prior phases lives in
  skills/plan-phase/SKILL.md, not the prompt.
*/ -}}
